    "Position": {
      "description": "A position in a single instrument.\n\nA position is *flat* when `quantity == 0`. Fills update the position via [`Position::apply_fill`]. Realized PnL accrues when a fill reduces or reverses the existing position; unrealized PnL is computed on demand against a mark price.\n\n``` use honba_entities::{Currency, Position, PositionSide}; use honba_messages::{InstrumentId, Exchange};\n\nlet id = InstrumentId::new(\"NIFTY50\", Exchange::new(\"NSE\")); let mut pos = Position::flat(id, Currency::Inr);\n\npos.apply_fill(PositionSide::Long, 75.0, 22_000.0); pos.apply_fill(PositionSide::Long, 25.0, 22_100.0);\n\nassert_eq!(pos.quantity(), 100.0); assert_eq!(pos.avg_price(), 22_025.0);   // (75*22000 + 25*22100) / 100 ```\n\nInvariants (checked by [`Position::validate`] and on deserialization): `quantity` and `avg_price` are finite and `>= 0` (the side carries the direction), `realized_pnl` is finite.",
      "properties": {
        "avg_price": {
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "currency": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Currency"
        },
        "instrument_id": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/InstrumentId"
        },
        "quantity": {
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "realized_pnl": {
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "side": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/PositionSide"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "avg_price",
        "currency",
        "instrument_id",
        "quantity",
        "realized_pnl",
        "side"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
